{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misuzu no Kuni</strong> is a linear visual novel with no branching choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is presented through visuals and sound, and progresses by clicking through the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime is around 2 to 3 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A replay gallery feature is included, allowing players to revisit visuals and listen to the original soundtrack experienced in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is set in an alternate version of late 20th century Japan, where an imaginary autonomous region called the \u201cLand of the Tengu\u201d exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, a girl named Misuzu enters the country and joins the training of the Tengu, leading to a fantasy school drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fantasy elements appear throughout the story, including divine beast-like spirits called \u201cBake,\u201d a Tengu princess, and magical powers known as \u201cJintsuuriki.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in Japanese only.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638590?t=1745564745","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638590?t=1745564745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638590/e5f1273453cc3193713b47dc5b1516b49788edc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745564745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638590/e5f1273453cc3193713b47dc5b1516b49788edc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745564745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misuzu no Kuni</strong> is a linear visual novel with no branching choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is presented through visuals and sound, and progresses by clicking through the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime is around 2 to 3 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A replay gallery feature is included, allowing players to revisit visuals and listen to the original soundtrack experienced in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is set in an alternate version of late 20th century Japan, where an imaginary autonomous region called the \u201cLand of the Tengu\u201d exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, a girl named Misuzu enters the country and joins the training of the Tengu, leading to a fantasy school drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various fantasy elements appear throughout the story, including divine beast-like spirits called \u201cBake,\u201d a Tengu princess, and magical powers known as \u201cJintsuuriki.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in Japanese only.</p>","developers":["StudioHommage"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638590/626dd61d5a1db49e6eb3ea64ff88f03389097b78/header.jpg?t=1745564745","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 StudioHommage. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u307f\u3059\u305a\u306e\u56fd","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u307f\u3059\u305a\u306e\u56fd - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $2.49 USD","packageid":1282486,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-50% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":249}],"title":"Buy \u307f\u3059\u305a\u306e\u56fd"}],"packages":[1282486],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><b